{"t":"Halls of Sacrifice","s":"halls-of-sacrifice-efedf","k":"outro","i":"assets/wiki/Halls_of_fame_1fc081.jpg","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p><b>Halls of Sacrifice</b> is the home of <a href=\"#/wiki/Necropharus\">Necropharus</a>. The teleport to the room is located to the south-east of the star room in <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>, close to the <a href=\"#/quest/medusa-shield-quest\">Medusa Shield Quest</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33045,32438,11\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33045, 32438, 11)</a>). To gain access, players must complete the 4000 <a href=\"#/wiki/Necromancer\">Necromancers</a> task of <a href=\"#/quest/killing-in-the-name-of-quest\">Killing in the Name of... Quest</a>.\n<br/>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Old Halls of Sacrifice\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"180\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Halls_of_fame_1fc081.jpg\" width=\"180\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Old Halls of Sacrifice</p> </figcaption> </figure><figure class=\"thumb show-info-icon\" style=\"width: 180px\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> <img alt=\"Old Entrance\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"139\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Halls_of_fame_entrance_e8941f.jpg\" width=\"180\"/> <figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> <svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg> <p class=\"caption\">Old Entrance</p> </figcaption> </figure>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"32pxd\"><img alt=\"32pxd\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Parchment_77aa91.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span><figcaption>32pxd</figcaption></figure><p><i>This  article is a stub. You can help TibiaWiki by expanding it.</i></p></div></div>","quests":[]}